    "result_text": "The change is complete and the full test suite is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `contactPreference` derived field on the owner read model, following the repository's existing pattern for computed DTO fields (like `locality`, `membershipLevel`).\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `contactPreference` property to the `Owner` schema (enum `EMAIL`/`PHONE`), so the OpenAPI generator emits the field and its `ContactPreferenceEnum` on `OwnerDto`.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Wired a MapStruct `@Mapping` that populates `contactPreference` via a new `contactPreference(Owner)` helper: returns `EMAIL` when the owner has a non-empty email, otherwise `PHONE`.\n\n**Verification:** `./mvnw test` \u2192 `BUILD SUCCESS`, all tests pass, including the two new acceptance tests (`corePhoneWhenNoEmail` \u2192 `PHONE`, `functionalityEmailWhenPresent` \u2192 `EMAIL`).",
